{"seq":3,"slug":"ancestral-stochastic","title":"祖先与随机采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-sampling-solvers/solvers/ancestral-stochastic","wordCount":1762,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"祖先与随机采样\">祖先与随机采样</h1><p>确定性求解器讲究每步精准、不偏离 ODE 轨迹。可有意思的是，Karras 在 2022 年的系统实验发现：在每步主动<strong>注入</strong>一点随机噪声，最终画质常常更好。这听起来违反直觉——明明在添乱，为什么有用？这一篇讲清随机采样的家族（DDPM 祖先、Euler a、SDE-DPM-Solver、Karras churn），它的纠错机制从何而来，以及它要付出的代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么注入噪声反而纠错\">核心概念：为什么注入噪声反而纠错</h2><p>回到 <a href=\"../foundations/sde-ode-view\">SDE 与 ODE 视角</a>：反向过程有两个化身，确定的 PF-ODE 和带随机项的反向 SDE。随机采样器走的是后者，每步多一项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(t)z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 的噪声注入。它的纠错作用可以这样理解——确定性求解器一旦因截断误差偏离了真实轨迹，就再也回不来，误差只会沿着错误轨迹累积；而随机采样器每步注入的新噪声，相当于把样本「轻轻晃回」当前噪声水平对应的高密度区，再由得分函数把它拉向数据流形。</p>\n<p>换句话说，随机性给了过程一个<strong>自我修正</strong>的机会：注入噪声 + 得分拉回 = 朗之万动力学式的纠偏。Karras 把这个旋钮叫 <strong>churn</strong>（搅动），用参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>churn</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{churn}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">churn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 控制每步先「加多少噪再去多少噪」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;当前 x_t&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;确定性去噪一步&lt;br/&gt;沿 PF-ODE&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C{&quot;是否注入噪声？&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|否·churn=0| D[&quot;纯确定&lt;br/&gt;误差不可逆累积&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|是·churn&gt;0| E[&quot;先加噪 σ↑&lt;br/&gt;再多去噪 σ↓&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;得分把样本拉回&lt;br/&gt;高密度流形·纠错&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;x_{t-1}&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G\">graph TD\n    A[\"当前 x_t\"] --&gt; B[\"确定性去噪一步&lt;br/&gt;沿 PF-ODE\"]\n    B --&gt; C{\"是否注入噪声？\"}\n    C --&gt;|否·churn=0| D[\"纯确定&lt;br/&gt;误差不可逆累积\"]\n    C --&gt;|是·churn&gt;0| E[\"先加噪 σ↑&lt;br/&gt;再多去噪 σ↓\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"得分把样本拉回&lt;br/&gt;高密度流形·纠错\"]\n    D --&gt; G[\"x_{t-1}\"]\n    F --&gt; G</pre><p>代价同样清楚：注入的噪声本身也带来方差，若步数不够、去噪不充分，残留噪声会让结果发糊。所以随机采样在<strong>步数充足</strong>时画质略胜，在<strong>极低步数</strong>时反而输给确定性求解器——这条规律决定了它的适用场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"随机采样家族\">随机采样家族</h2><p>「随机」这个标签下其实站着好几种机制不同的采样器。下表把主流的几位归位（确定/随机的轴见 <a href=\"../foundations/sampler-taxonomy\">求解器谱系</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>采样器</th>\n<th>随机性来源</th>\n<th>阶数</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DDPM 祖先采样</td>\n<td>每步 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 注入</td>\n<td>一阶</td>\n<td>原始、最慢（~1000 步）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Euler a（ancestral）</td>\n<td>每步重新采样残差噪声</td>\n<td>一阶</td>\n<td>UI 常见，多样性高，难收敛到定值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DPM++ 2M SDE</td>\n<td>指数积分器 + 随机项</td>\n<td>二阶多步</td>\n<td>高阶随机，画质与速度兼顾</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DPM++ SDE（2S）</td>\n<td>单步内随机校正</td>\n<td>二阶单步</td>\n<td>稳但慢，NFE 翻倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Karras churn（EDM）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>churn</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{churn}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">churn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 受控注入</td>\n<td>配二阶 Heun</td>\n<td>可调随机强度，研究基准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意 DDIM 其实也是这个家族的一员——它正是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）调到 0 的那个极端（见 <a href=\"ddim-deterministic\">DDIM 确定性采样</a>）。所以「确定」与「随机」不是两个孤立阵营，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta\\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 这一根连续旋钮的两端，Euler a 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，DDIM 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，中间任意取值都合法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"a-后缀与不收敛的陷阱\">「a」后缀与不收敛的陷阱</h2><p>UI 里带 <strong>a</strong> 后缀的采样器（Euler a、DPM++ 2S a）是祖先采样，有一个工程上必须知道的副作用：<strong>它们不随步数收敛到固定图像</strong>。确定性采样器加步数会逼近 ODE 的唯一解，图越来越稳；而祖先采样每步注入的新噪声让最终结果随步数持续变化，30 步和 50 步可能是两张明显不同的图。</p>\n<p>这带来两个实践后果。其一，<strong>调参时别用祖先采样器找「最优步数」</strong>——它没有收敛点，你会被不断变化的画面误导（详见 <a href=\"../practice/sampler-tuning\">采样调参</a>）。其二，祖先采样的多样性优势在「同提示词要多样产出」时是福音，在「要复现某张满意结果」时是噩梦，因为它对种子和步数都更敏感。需要可复现、可反演（如图像编辑）时，必须用确定性求解器。一个常见的稳妥默认是：探索阶段用 Euler a 看多样性，定稿与编辑阶段切到 DPM++ 2M 或 DDIM。</p>\n<h2 id=\"churn-怎么调-一个被低估的旋钮\">churn 怎么调：一个被低估的旋钮</h2><p>Karras 的 EDM 框架把随机性变成一个可量化、可扫描的连续旋钮 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>churn</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{churn}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">churn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而不是「带 a 就随机、不带就确定」的二选一。它的工作方式是：每步先把样本沿噪声轴<strong>向上</strong>推一点（加噪到略高的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>），再用确定性求解器<strong>向下</strong>多走一段（去噪回更低的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>）。加得越多，注入的随机性越强、纠错越猛，但残留方差风险也越大。EDM 还配了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>tmin</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{tmin}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tmin</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>tmax</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{tmax}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tmax</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 限定只在中间噪声段注入——因为最高噪声段加噪无意义、最低噪声段加噪会毁细节。</p>\n<p>实践含义是：随机性不必全有或全无。在 EDM 风格的采样器里，你可以把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>churn</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{churn}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">churn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从 0（纯确定）平滑调到较大值（强随机），找到画质与稳定的甜点。多数情况下，一个适中的 churn 配二阶 Heun，比纯确定或纯祖先采样都更优——这也是 EDM 论文当年刷新 ImageNet FID 的关键配方之一。可惜大多数 UI 把这个旋钮藏得很深或干脆不暴露，导致它被严重低估；真要榨干画质，它值得一试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"随机-vs-确定-怎么选\">随机 vs 确定：怎么选</h2><p>把这笔账算总：随机采样在<strong>步数充足、追求画质上限与多样性、对一张图反复抽卡</strong>时占优，因其纠错机制能把样本拉得更贴近数据分布；确定采样在<strong>极低步数、要可复现、要做反演与插值、要蒸馏教师轨迹</strong>时占优，因其轨迹唯一且稳定。2026 年的生产现实是：大多数高质量离线出图用 DPM++ 2M（确定）或 DPM++ 2M SDE（随机）两者择一试，少步蒸馏模型（见 <a href=\"../acceleration/consistency-models\">一致性模型</a>）则几乎都走确定路线，因为在 1~4 步的极端区间，随机注入的方差来不及被去掉，确定性才稳。理解了这条分界，菜单里那些带不带「a」「SDE」后缀的名字就不再神秘——它们只是在确定/随机这根旋钮上取了不同的值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>随机采样走反向 SDE，每步注入噪声；注入 + 得分拉回构成自我纠错，让样本贴回高密度流形。</li>\n<li>纠错有代价：注入的噪声带方差，步数不足时残留导致发糊，故随机采样在充足步数下胜、极低步数下负。</li>\n<li>家族成员（DDPM、Euler a、DPM++ SDE、Karras churn）机制各异，但都可看作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 旋钮非零的取值，DDIM 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 的极端。</li>\n<li>带「a」的祖先采样不随步数收敛，不能用来找最优步数，且难复现，编辑/反演场景须改用确定性求解器。</li>\n<li>选择原则：充足步数追画质多样性用随机，极低步数/可复现/反演/蒸馏教师用确定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 的另一极端与可反演性：<a href=\"ddim-deterministic\">DDIM 确定性采样</a></li>\n<li>把随机项也纳入指数积分器的高阶版：<a href=\"dpm-solver\">DPM-Solver 高阶</a></li>\n<li>为何少步蒸馏几乎都走确定路线：<a href=\"../acceleration/consistency-models\">一致性模型</a></li>\n<li>跨库：扩散理论里前向/反向过程的概率推导见 <a href=\"../../generative-ai/diffusion-models/diffusion-theory\">生成式 AI · 扩散理论</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"祖先与随机采样","id":"祖先与随机采样"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么注入噪声反而纠错","id":"核心概念-为什么注入噪声反而纠错"},{"level":2,"text":"随机采样家族","id":"随机采样家族"},{"level":2,"text":"「a」后缀与不收敛的陷阱","id":"a-后缀与不收敛的陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"churn 怎么调：一个被低估的旋钮","id":"churn-怎么调-一个被低估的旋钮"},{"level":2,"text":"随机 vs 确定：怎么选","id":"随机-vs-确定-怎么选"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"DPM-Solver 高阶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-sampling-solvers/solvers/dpm-solver"},"next":{"title":"步数蒸馏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-sampling-solvers/acceleration/step-distillation"}}